ips:**.\n   - From the first part of the context, we know that the lion is kind.\n   - The mouse chases the lion, which means the mouse is chasing a kind animal (the lion).\n   - The rabbit is blue and round, so it is kind.\n   - The tiger is blue and cold, so it is not kind.The tiger is not young, and we have all the information about its behavior towards other animals.. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
