\n   - The lion visits the bald eagle, showing interaction between the lion and the bald eagle.\n   - The lion visits the dog, indicating the lion has a presence in the area.\n   - The lion is young, providing a descriptor for the lion\'s age.The lion is not big.. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
