text.\n   - "Fiona is blue."This is directly stated in the context.\n   - "Fiona is white."This is directly stated in the context.\n   - "Gary is blue."This is directly stated in the context.\n   - "Gary is kind."This is directly stated in the context.\n   - "Furry, nice things are white."Charlie is not young.. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
