False): This would require that Charlie is young, but we do not have enough information to confirm this either.\n   - Option C (Unknown): This is the most suitable choice because we do not have enough information to definitively say whether Charlie is old or not.\n\nTherefore, based on the given information, the correct answer is:.\n<answer>\n. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
