t the mouse does see the squirrel.\n4.**Conclusion**: The presence of both direct and indirect evidence supports the fact that the mouse sees the squirrel, leading to a clear conclusion that the statement "The mouse sees the squirrel" is true.\n\n<answer>\n. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
