 the lion.\n14.If the cat doesn\'t need the rabbit and the rabbit doesn\'t see the bald eagle then the bald eagle doesn\'t see the cat.\n15.If the rabbit doesn\'t visit the lion and the rabbit doesn\'t need the cat then the cat is square.\n16.If nothing visits the rabbit then the rabbit doesn\'t need the bald eagle.\n17.If nothing visits the lion and the lion doesn\'t need the cat then it doesn\'t need the cat.\n. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
