 then they are rough.\n15.If someone is blue and they see the tiger then the tiger needs the squirrel.\n16.If the mouse needs the bald eagle and the bald eagle likes the mouse then the bald eagle is rough.\n17.If the mouse needs the squirrel then the squirrel likes the mouse.\n18.If someone is rough then they see the mouse.\n19.If someone needs the tiger and the tiger is kind then they like the bald eagle.\nThe squirrel does need the squirrel.. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
