ent "The rabbit is rough" is fully supported by the information provided.\n   - The rabbit\'s behavior of chasing the cat and the tiger clearly indicates its rough nature.\n\n5.**Conclusion:**.\n   - Based on the evidence presented, it is safe to conclude that the rabbit is indeed rough.\n   - Therefore, the statement "The rabbit is rough" is supported by the given information.\n\n<answer>\n. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
